    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what's the point of having integrity if it just leaves you with nothing? i look at my life and i don't even recognize it anymore. it's like i'm walking through a fog and there's no path forward. everyone else moved on, they're happy, and i'm just... stuck in this void. it feels like the world is just better off without this mess i've become.",
