      "content": "i know people say it's temporary but it doesn't feel like it. it feels like i just broke myself for a lost cause. everything i worked for is gone and the people i thought i knew are gone too. it's just exhausting to keep fighting a world that rewards the people who lied and punishes the ones who didn't. i'm just so tired of the struggle. it honestly feels like there's no dignity in just existing like this.",
